  "description": "A Roslyn incremental source generator that turns a partial class into a fully thread-safe, lock-free Active Object around a Stateless state machine. Decorate a class with [ActiveObjectAsync] (Channel + Task) or [ActiveObjectSync] (Thread + BlockingCollection) and declare partial trigger methods with [StateTrigger]; the generator emits the mailbox, worker, message types, constructor and disposal. The marker attributes are injected into your compilation automatically, so the package is analyzer-only and depends solely on Stateless.",
