  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Active Objects can be named via the attribute (Name = \"…\") or the constructor. The sync worker Thread is named accordingly; the async worker publishes the name via a static AsyncLocal CurrentActiveObjectName. Analyzer-only package; ASM001-ASM006 diagnostics.",
